---
// FAQ section component
// Answers common questions using industry-specific terminology
---

<section id="faq" class="w-full bg-gray-50 scroll-mt-24 px-4 sm:px-6">
	<div class="section-inner flex flex-col gap-4">
		<div class="text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
			<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900">Questions?</h2>
			<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl self-center">
				Everything you need to know about how we help you get better leads and write more paper.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="w-full space-y-6">
			<!-- FAQ Item 1: How does the system work? -->
			<details class="faq-box bg-white border border-[#93c5fd] rounded-xl reveal group shadow-sm">
				<summary class="cursor-pointer text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-[#1e40af] transition-colors flex items-center justify-between">
					<span>How does the system work?</span>
					<span class="text-[#1e40af] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
				</summary>
				<p class="mt-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					It comes down to two things. <strong>One is AI:</strong> we've built an AI annuity opportunity finder that finds people age 55–77, near or at retirement, with $100K+ rollover‑eligible assets and a recent life event that's triggered them to think about annuities. <strong>Two is the market:</strong> more people moving into retirement, worried about volatility, wanting to roll assets into an annuity, the timing is right. We don't send you raw AI leads: we verify they're real people (OTP), get them to opt in and confirm assets and state, and we only send you prospects in the states you're licensed in. You get consistent qualified annuity prospects daily, exclusive to you.
				</p>
			</details>

			<!-- FAQ Item 2: Why speed to lead? -->
			<details class="faq-box bg-white border border-[#93c5fd] rounded-xl reveal group shadow-sm">
				<summary class="cursor-pointer text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-[#1e40af] transition-colors flex items-center justify-between">
					<span>Why is speed to lead so important?</span>
					<span class="text-[#1e40af] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
				</summary>
				<p class="mt-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					We're triggering these prospects to think about annuities. If you don't contact them as soon as possible, they'll go to someone else. So you have to be onto it, contact them quickly and consistently. We work with producers who do that. If you can't make an appointment, let us know; otherwise, the producers who get the most out of our system are the ones who work the leads fast.
				</p>
			</details>

			<!-- FAQ Item 3: Exclusive + state-matched -->
			<details class="faq-box bg-white border border-[#93c5fd] rounded-xl reveal group shadow-sm">
				<summary class="cursor-pointer text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-[#1e40af] transition-colors flex items-center justify-between">
					<span>Are all the prospects exclusive? Do you only send prospects in my licensed states?</span>
					<span class="text-[#1e40af] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
				</summary>
				<p class="mt-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					100% exclusive. No other agency or producer will ever see your prospects. And yes, we only send you prospects in the states you're licensed for. We check state as part of our opt-in process so you never get leads you can't work. Every prospect is yours alone and qualified for your footprint.
				</p>
			</details>

			<!-- FAQ Item 4: Who are you looking for? -->
			<details class="faq-box bg-white border border-[#93c5fd] rounded-xl reveal group shadow-sm">
				<summary class="cursor-pointer text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-[#1e40af] transition-colors flex items-center justify-between">
					<span>Who are you looking to work with?</span>
					<span class="text-[#1e40af] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
				</summary>
				<p class="mt-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					We're looking for high-performing salespeople, or people who want to be. We can send you a lead, but if you're not contacting them quickly and consistently, you won't get the most out of these annuity opportunities. We want producers who are serious about working leads and who want to help people protect their assets. Top annuity salespeople, ideally, or at least that's who you want to be. If you're excited to work in the annuity space and get more qualified annuity prospects, we're excited to work with you.
				</p>
			</details>

			<!-- FAQ Item 5: Why don't you close them yourself? -->
			<details class="faq-box bg-white border border-[#93c5fd] rounded-xl reveal group shadow-sm">
				<summary class="cursor-pointer text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-[#1e40af] transition-colors flex items-center justify-between">
					<span>If the prospects are so good, why don't you close them yourself?</span>
					<span class="text-[#1e40af] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
				</summary>
				<p class="mt-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					We do, a lot of them. We have partnerships with agencies that yield an extremely high return, and we copy the same system into your business. We're producers too. We write FIAs, MYGAs, and understand the comp structure. We know what it's like to chase rates and navigate carrier relationships. The system works; we're just scaling it to more producers.
				</p>
			</details>

			<!-- FAQ Item 6: Carriers -->
			<details class="faq-box bg-white border border-[#93c5fd] rounded-xl reveal group shadow-sm">
				<summary class="cursor-pointer text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-[#1e40af] transition-colors flex items-center justify-between">
					<span>Which carriers do your prospects typically work with?</span>
					<span class="text-[#1e40af] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
				</summary>
				<p class="mt-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					Our prospects are qualified for all major carriers. We work with producers writing paper with Allianz Life, Athene, Jackson National, Corebridge Financial, Nationwide, Prudential, F&G, North American, and MassMutual. They have the assets and are ready to have the conversation about FIAs, MYGAs, and the right chassis for their situation.
				</p>
			</details>

			<!-- FAQ Item 7: Suitability -->
			<details class="faq-box bg-white border border-[#93c5fd] rounded-xl reveal group shadow-sm">
				<summary class="cursor-pointer text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-[#1e40af] transition-colors flex items-center justify-between">
					<span>How do you handle suitability and compliance?</span>
					<span class="text-[#1e40af] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
				</summary>
				<p class="mt-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					We do the heavy lifting upfront. Our prospects are pre-qualified, we confirm assets, retirement window, and state. We don't send you prospects that will get kicked back by compliance because the concentration is too high or the age doesn't match. You can focus on writing paper, not fighting with carriers over suitability questionnaires.
				</p>
			</details>
		</div>

		<div class="text-center">
			<a href="https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/booking/TkuYjNB6MiVU90uJMYJ4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-cta inline-flex items-center justify-center min-w-[280px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1e40af] to-[#1e293b] rounded-2xl text-xl font-semibold hover:from-[#1e3a8a] hover:to-[#0f172a] transition-all transform hover:scale-105 text-white">
				Still Have Questions? Book a Call →
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

